{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rencheng-e-c3859365e05c0663f517","title":"鱼豢论曹彰曹植处境及杨修丁仪之死","accounts":[{"id":"rencheng-a-c3859365e05c0663f517","label":"裴注·鱼豢评说","text":"鱼豢论曹彰曹植处境及杨修丁仪之死","evidence":["rencheng-q-ebf274e50720ec0106d5"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["rencheng-q-ebf274e50720ec0106d5"]},"ordering_evidence":"rencheng-q-ebf274e50720ec0106d5","order":3831}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"rencheng-q-ebf274e50720ec0106d5","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-fa371420689a4ec732c5","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞鱼豢曰：“谚言‘贫不学俭，卑不学恭’，非人性〔殊〕分也，势使然耳。此实然之势，信不虚矣。假令太祖防遏植等，在于畴昔；此贤之心，何缘有窥望乎？彰之挟恨，尚无所至；至于植者，〔岂能兴难？〕乃令杨修以倚注遇害，丁仪以希意族灭。哀夫！余每览植之华采，思若有神；以此推之，太祖之动心，亦良有以也。”","attribution":"裴注·鱼豢评说","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-42cdc8d83a09981b77dd","start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
